   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU-UN Policies, SSR, Training of personnel and guest students</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance in (mainly) UN policy development. Training of personnel and capacity building for pre-deployment training or mission induction training, i.e. assistance to pre-deployment training in Bosnia-Hercegovina, Croatia, Ethiopia, Slovenia and Spain or induction training projects performed in Liberia and South Sudan. Set up of different courses in Sweden, such as IPOC (International Police Officer Course) and IGO (Integrating Gender in Operations).</narrative>
